│                                                                             │
│  **Tables to use:**                                                         │
│  - actors (to get the list of actors)                                       │
│  - movies (to get the list of movies)                                       │
│  - genres (to get the list of genres)                                       │
│  - movie_genres (to link movies with their respective genres)               │
│  - movie_actors (to link movies with their respective actors)               │
│                                                                             │
│  **Reasons:**                                                               │
│  - The question asks for the top 3 actors who have acted in the most        │
│  genres, so we need to link actors with the genres of the movies they have  │
│  acted in.                                                                  │
│                                                                             │
│  **Columns to SELECT:**                                                     │
│  - actors.name (to get the name of the actor)                               │
│  - COUNT(DISTINCT genres.name) (to count the number of distinct genres      │
│  each actor has acted in)                                                   │
│                                                                             │
│  **Filtering conditions (WHERE):**                                          │
│  - None                                                                     │
